# Normalise line endings for text, and never touch binaries.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true. Git's binary heuristic has so far
# spared the CV PDF, but that is luck rather than a guarantee — a regenerated
# PDF whose bytes happen to look text-like would be silently corrupted on
# checkout. Mark the binary types explicitly instead of relying on detection.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
